      },
      "message": "docs(data): add long_name and description for H extension instructions\n\nReplace placeholder text with accurate documentation for all 15\nHypervisor extension instructions:\n\nLoad instructions (hlv.*):\n- hlv.b/bu: Load byte (signed/unsigned)\n- hlv.h/hu: Load halfword (signed/unsigned)\n- hlv.w/wu: Load word (signed/unsigned)\n- hlv.d: Load doubleword\n\nExecutable load instructions (hlvx.*):\n- hlvx.hu: Load halfword for instruction fetch emulation\n- hlvx.wu: Load word for instruction fetch emulation\n\nStore instructions (hsv.*):\n- hsv.b/h/w/d: Store byte/halfword/word/doubleword\n\nFence instructions:\n- hfence.gvma: Invalidate guest-physical address translations\n- hfence.vvma: Invalidate guest virtual address translations\n\nAll descriptions explain the as though V=1 semantics for hypervisor\nvirtual memory access.\n\nCo-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>",
